Lets add some new file operation features to `std://file-blocks.convo` via a FILE_OP xml tag:

- `rename`: Rename a file
- `delete`: Delete a file
- `setMode`: Set the mode `chmod` of a file

Example:

``` convo

\> assistant

<FILE_OP op="rename" from="path/to/current/location" to="path/to/new/location"/>
<FILE_OP op="delete" path="path/to/location"/>
<FILE_OP op="delete" path="path/to/location/*.ts"/>
<FILE_OP op="delete" path="path/to/location/**.ts"/>
<FILE_OP op="setMode" path="path/to/location" mode="700"/>
<FILE_OP op="setMode" path="path/to/location" mode="+x"/>

```

The delete and setMode ops paths should support globs

